url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T00:53:26Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T00:53:26Z","body":"Could you also test Godot 4.5.0 stable and 4.7 dev 3?\n\n<br>\n\n> A new empty Godot project does NOT have this issue\n\nOn 4.6.1, Godot uses `D3D12` as default driver for Windows with `Forward+` and `Mobile` renderers, could you test the project you're using to reproduce this issue with `D3D12` to see if the bug stops? You can change this on Project Settings `rendering/rendering_device/driver.windows`. Also, check if the bug happens using the `Compatibility` renderer","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189855405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4190067153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118216#issuecomment-4190067153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118216","id":4190067153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75v1nR","user":{"login":"goddeath23333","id":34572152,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NTcyMTUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34572152?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333","html_url":"https://github.com/goddeath23333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T02:40:01Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T02:40:01Z","body":"> 您能否也测试一下 Godot 4.5.0 稳定版和 4.7 开发版 3？\n> \n> \n> > 新建一个空的 Godot 项目不会出现这个问题。\n> \n> 在 Godot 4.6.1 版本中，`D3D12`Windows 系统默认使用`Forward+`和`Mobile`渲染器，您能否使用 测试一下您用于重现此问题的项目，`D3D12`看看问题是否消失？您可以在项目设置中更改此设置。另外，请检查使用渲染器`rendering/rendering_device/driver.windows`时是否会出现此问题。`Compatibility`\n\n Test Results\nD3D12 Driver Test ✅\nI tested with `--rendering-driver d3d12` and the flickering issue is resolved \nNo screen flickering on startup. Window resizing still has some frame drops but no flickering.\nVulkan Driver (Default) ❌ The issue persists with the default Vulkan driver\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4190067153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4190233144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118216#issuecomment-4190233144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118216","id":4190233144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75weI4","user":{"login":"goddeath23333","id":34572152,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NTcyMTUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34572152?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333","html_url":"https://github.com/goddeath23333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goddeath23333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T04:03:53Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T04:03:53Z","body":"> 您能否也测试一下 Godot 4.5.0 稳定版和 4.7 开发版 3？\n> \n> \n> > 新建一个空的 Godot 项目不会出现这个问题。\n> \n> 在 Godot 4.6.1 版本中，`D3D12`Windows 系统默认使用`Forward+`和`Mobile`渲染器，您能否使用 测试一下您用于重现此问题的项目，`D3D12`看看问题是否消失？您可以在项目设置中更改此设置。另外，请检查使用渲染器`rendering/rendering_device/driver.windows`时是否会出现此问题。`Compatibility`\n\nRoot Cause Found\nThe issue is caused by NVIDIA AI Frame Generation (DLSS 3 Frame Generation) on RTX 5080.\nWhen global AI frame generation is enabled in NVIDIA Control Panel, the flickering occurs. Disabling AI frame generation for global resolves the issue.\nFurthermore, it has been observed that the RTX 5080’s AI frame generation not only causes visual artifacts but also interferes with Godot’s editor stability—leading to UI tearing in the project launcher, crashes when adding child nodes in the scene tree, and even failures during new project initialization.\nThis appears to be a compatibility issue between Godot's Vulkan renderer and NVIDIA's frame generation technology, not a bug in Godot itself.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4190233144/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]